  {"id": "document:packages/attachment/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/attachment/README.md", "summary": "attachment 包组 README：耐用图像附件能力家族地图——dsh-attachment 提供提示词/命令附图（ctx.attachments），attachment-local 在 DSH_HOME 下本机存储；存续重启、永不自动删除、仅光栅格式。", "tags": ["documentation", "package-group", "attachments"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/attachment/attachment/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment/README.md", "summary": "dsh-attachment 包 README：图像（PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF，验证+归一化）与通用文件（逐字节保存，模型经只读路径按需读取）两类附件；durable session 事件排除浏览器路径/provider URL/本地路径/base64。", "tags": ["documentation", "attachments", "service-definition"], "complexity": "moderate"},
