  {"id": "config:packages/attachment/attachment/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "document:packages/attachment/attachment-local/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/README.md", "summary": "dsh-attachment-local 包 README：DSH_HOME 下本机存储——图像验证归一化按路由缓存，通用文件无准入限制逐字节保存；同字节只存一份，读取核长度与内容，限额收紧后已入库图像仍可读。", "tags": ["documentation", "local-storage", "content-addressed"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/attachment/attachment-local/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-attachment-local 包清单：本机附件存储 Provider 的依赖与 ESM 导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "type": "file", "name": "file-store.ts", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "summary": "通用文件的逐字内容寻址存储：sha256 摘要命名的不可变对象（file-objects/前2字符分桶）+ 以净化显示名为叶子的别名路径（files/ 下以真实文件名结尾），读取流式校验字节长度与摘要；显示名净化双分隔符剥离防 POSIX 主机泄漏 Windows 客户端全路径。", "tags": ["content-addressed", "file-storage", "integrity-verification", "name-sanitization"], "complexity": "complex", "languageNotes": "fileLeafName 手工剥离 / 与 \\ 两种分隔符（POSIX 的 path.basename 会把 \\ 当普通字符泄漏客户端路径）；Windows 保留设备名前缀 _、UTF-8 255 字节截断；readFileStreamVerbatim 为 async generator，tree-sitter 易漏提取。"},
  {"id": "function:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts:fileLeafName", "type": "function", "name": "fileLeafName", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "lineRange": [45, 56], "summary": "把调用方显示名净化为安全叶子名：剥离两种分隔符、去控制字符、Windows 非法字符替换为 _、保留设备名加前缀、UTF-8 255 字节截断，空/./.. 回落 'file'。", "tags": ["sanitization", "cross-platform", "path-safety"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts:storedFilePath", "type": "function", "name": "storedFilePath", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "lineRange": [75, 78], "summary": "校验引用格式（sha256:64hex 且 name 与净化结果一致）后派生以净化名结尾的别名绝对路径，不读对象。", "tags": ["path-derivation", "validation"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts:saveFileVerbatim", "type": "function", "name": "saveFileVerbatim", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "lineRange": [91, 105], "summary": "整段字节提交：sha256 后先发布不可变对象再发布别名，返回 attachmentId/name/bytes 的 FileAttachmentRef。", "tags": ["content-addressed", "immutable-publish", "save"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts:saveFileStreamVerbatim", "type": "function", "name": "saveFileStreamVerbatim", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "lineRange": [113, 138], "summary": "有界分块流式提交：publishImmutableObjectStream 边读边算摘要定对象路径，随后发布别名并双重 throwIfAborted，返回内容寻址引用。", "tags": ["streaming", "immutable-publish", "cancellation"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "function:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts:readFileStreamVerbatim", "type": "function", "name": "readFileStreamVerbatim", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/file-store.ts", "lineRange": [147, 181], "summary": "async generator 逐块读已存文件：ENOENT 映射 ATTACHMENT_NOT_FOUND，流末校验字节长度与 sha256 摘要不符抛 ATTACHMENT_CORRUPT。", "tags": ["async-generator", "integrity-verification", "error-mapping"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "file:packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/sharp.ts", "type": "file", "name": "sharp.ts", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/src/sharp.ts", "summary": "进程域内对 Sharp CommonJS 入口的惰性访问：requireSharp 经 createLazyRequire 在首次光栅操作时才加载 sharp 并保留可调用导出。", "tags": ["lazy-loading", "native-module", "image-processing"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "config:packages/attachment/attachment-local/tsconfig.json", "type": "config", "name": "tsconfig.json", "filePath": "packages/attachment/attachment-local/tsconfig.json", "summary": "包级 TypeScript 配置：extends 基座、rootDir src、outDir lib/types 并引用工作区依赖。", "tags": ["configuration", "typescript"], "complexity": "simple"}
